@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos:  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# The repo-wide GMEOW validation surface is authored entirely as logic: core content in the
# owning slice modules and projected to generated/shapes/*. This root file carries no
# hand-authored sh:NodeShape: every check is a canonical logic: constraint or an EL-safe OWL/RDFS
# axiom whose SHACL image the pipeline derives. The file is retained (not deleted) as the stable,
# intentionally shape-free anchor for the root validation namespace.
